title Ontology to stores: validation path and GRAPH TYPE
direction right
colorMode bold
styleMode shadow

Release [shape: oval, icon: package, color: blue, label: "Released packages + data"]

Before the load (files) [color: orange] {
  V1 [icon: check-square, label: "V1 Design rules: one kind + one range per predicate (Rule 1); cardinality shape (Rule 2); prefixes"]
  V2 [icon: shield, label: "V2 Full SHACL with pySHACL + SHACL-AF over the asserted data, before reasoning: 0 violations"]
  V3 [icon: cpu, label: "V3 Reason once (ROBOT + ELK); keep only real inferences"]
  V4 [icon: file, label: "V4 check-serialised, then full SHACL over asserted + inferred: 0 violations"]
  V5 [icon: hash, label: "V5 Manifest: SHA-256 of every input and shape file"]
}

In the local Neo4j (n10s) [color: green] {
  V6 [icon: download, label: "V6 Load in fixed order; every import returns OK"]
  V7 [icon: eye, label: "V7 Engine readback: listShapes() vs the shapes file; every constraint n10s did not compile is listed (V2 already checked it)"]
  V8 [icon: shield, label: "V8 n10s SHACL validate(): 0 violations"]
  V9 [icon: zap, label: "V9 One fail case per compiled constraint: must name the right node, path and component; a committed mutant is caught, then restored"]
  V10 [icon: refresh-cw, label: "V10 Round trip: export back to RDF, 0 triples lost, 0 added"]
  V11 [icon: repeat, label: "V11 Determinism: sorted and shuffled loads give one hash"]
  V12 [icon: lock, label: "V12 Report written only when all pass; check-report: every check, fingerprints current"]
}

Delivery [color: purple] {
  V13 [icon: cloud, label: "V13 Aura copy: Aura hash = local hash = report hash"]
  V14 [icon: database, label: "V14 Triple store: counts per graph, per predicate; three-way (files, store, Neo4j) with --projection-report"]
}

GRAPH TYPE on Aura [color: red] {
  G1 [icon: code, label: "G1 build.py graph-type --output: one statement from the sh:targetClass shapes; left-out list as comments (coverage depends on sh:targetClass shapes)"]
  G2 [icon: upload, label: "G2 Apply after V13: ALTER CURRENT GRAPH TYPE SET; confirm with SHOW CURRENT GRAPH TYPE"]
  G3 [icon: x-octagon, label: "G3 Probe: a write that breaks the type must fail (ConstraintValidationFailed)"]
  G4 [icon: users, label: "G4 From then on Aura rejects bad writes from apps; n10s cannot run there"]
}

Fail [shape: oval, icon: alert-triangle, color: red, label: "Any failure stops the run; no report"]

Release > V1 > V2 > V3 > V4 > V5
V5 > V6 > V7 > V8 > V9 > V10 > V11 > V12
V12 > V13
V12 > V14
V13 > G1 > G2 > G3 > G4
V2 --> Fail
V9 --> Fail
V10 --> Fail
V13 --> Fail
